{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01a06a6887ce7973af661741","type":"tool_result","content":"The parametrization uses **\"repo\"** for most cases, with a single exception using **\"url\"**. The six parameter sets are:\n\n1. `{}` — empty dict\n2. `{\"repo\": \"{path}\"}`\n3. `{\"repo\": \"{path}\", \"rev\": \"{default_branch}\"}`\n4. `{\"repo\": \"file://{posixpath}\"}`\n5. `{\"repo\": \"file://{posixpath}\", \"rev\": \"{default_branch}\"}`\n6. `{\"url\": \"{path}\"}`\n\nThe one \"url\" case is explicitly noted in the code as a `# test for backward compatibility` — it's not the primary key. The test bodies also reflect this: the code checks `fs_kwargs.get(\"repo\")` first and then falls back to `fs_kwargs.get(\"url\")` when formatting paths."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ced045f-2deb-4a03-96b6-51f3c49ecc7b","uuid":"9e282299-f4a1-4b78-a057-cf38f7c120f8","timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:13:53.593Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":4422,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The parametrization uses **\"repo\"** for most cases, with a single exception using **\"url\"**. The six parameter sets are:\n\n1. `{}` — empty dict\n2. `{\"repo\": \"{path}\"}`\n3. `{\"repo\": \"{path}\", \"rev\": \"{default_branch}\"}`\n4. `{\"repo\": \"file://{posixpath}\"}`\n5. `{\"repo\": \"file://{posixpath}\", \"rev\": \"{default_branch}\"}`\n6. `{\"url\": \"{path}\"}`\n\nThe one \"url\" case is explicitly noted in the code as a `# test for backward compatibility` — it's not the primary key. The test bodies also reflect this: the code checks `fs_kwargs.get(\"repo\")` first and then falls back to `fs_kwargs.get(\"url\")` when formatting paths.","durationMs":2704,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iterative/dvc/main/dvc/testing/api_tests.py"}}
