{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788492335-UVPWQIuO22ND1dISIuX3","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 12 `test_filesystem` cases pass, including `local_url` (the backward-compat case). \n\nEverything is complete. Let me do a final summary of the changes. Also, I should double-check that nothing else in the codebase passes `url=` to `DVCFileSystem`/`_DVCFileSystem` that I might have missed — I already grepped and found none. Also check `dvc/repo/get.py`, `dvc/api/dataset.py` etc. use `repo=` or positional — verified earlier via grep (no `url=` matches).\n\nOne last sanity check on the final state of the diff stat, and confirm the goal is met. Done — summarize.\n\nSummary of what changed:\n\n1. `dvc/fs/dvc.py` — `_DVCFileSystem.__init__`:\n   - `url: Optional[str]` + `repo: Optional[Repo]` merged into single `repo: Union[\"Repo\", os.PathLike[str], str, None] = None`\n   - Resolution order: `repo` → `fo` (fsspec chaining) → legacy `url` kwarg (backward compat)\n   - `Repo` instance → stored directly as `self._repo`, used as-is (no new connection); str/PathLike → `os.fspath(repo)` into `_repo_kwargs[\"url\"]`\n   - Docstring updated\n2. `dvc/dependency/repo.py` — `RepoDependency._make_fs` passes `repo=` instead of `url=`\n3. `dvc/testing/api_tests.py` — parametrization updated to `repo=`, plus `{\"url\": \"{path}\"}` retained as explicit backward-compat case (`local_url` id)\n4. `tests/unit/fs/test_dvc.py` — new `test_init_arg` (str/PathLike/Repo/url-compat)\n5. `tests/unit/fs/test_dvcfs.py` — `DVCFileSystem(url=tmp_dir)` → positional `DVCFileSystem(tmp_dir)`; new `test_init_arg` with 9 cases\n\nTest results: 164 fs+dependency unit tests pass; 34 api func tests pass; 260/261 in the wider sweep pass with the 1 failure pre-existing; test_get/external_repo/unit repo pass with 2 pre-existing celery failures.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequ