{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788492335-UVPWQIuO22ND1dISIuX3","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass, including the `local_url` backward-compat case. The implementation is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `url` parameter conflicted with fsspec's `url_to_fs(url, **kwargs)` signature — fsspec's own first parameter is named `url`, so passing the repo URL through `storage_options={\"url\": ...}` raised `TypeError: url_to_fs() got multiple values for argument 'url'` (broken HuggingFace Datasets integration, iterative/dvc#10700). The fix merges the repository specification into a single `repo` parameter, matching `dvc.api.open`/`dvc.api.read`:\n\n**`dvc/fs/dvc.py`** — `_DVCFileSystem.__init__` (dvc/fs/dvc.py:86)\n- `url: Optional[str]` and `repo: Optional[\"Repo\"]` merged into one `repo: Union[\"Repo\", os.PathLike[str], str, None] = None`\n- Resolution order: `repo` → `fo` (fsspec chained URLs) → legacy `url` kwarg (`kwargs.get(\"url\")`, kept for backward compatibility)\n- A `Repo` instance is stored directly as `self._repo` and used as-is (no new connection); a str/PathLike is converted via `os.fspath()` into the deferred `_repo_kwargs[\"url\"]`\n- Docstring documents the unified parameter; `rev`, `subrepos`, `config`, `remote`, `remote_config` all still flow through unchanged\n\n**`dvc/dependency/repo.py`** — `RepoDependency._make_fs` (dvc/dependency/repo.py:157) now passes `repo=self.def_repo[self.PARAM_URL]`, so dependency resolution uses the same convention\n\n**`dvc/testing/api_tests.py`** — parametrization switched to `repo=`, with `{\"url\": \"{path}\"}` retained as an explicit backward-compat case (`local_url`)\n\n**Tests** — new `test_init_arg` in both `tests/unit/fs/test_dvc.py` (kwargs: str/PathLike/Repo/legacy `url=`) and `tests/unit/fs/test_dvcfs.py` (positional, `repo=`, legacy `url=`, `Repo` instance); `test_maxdepth` updated to positional style\n\nVerified behavior:\n- `url_to_fs(\"dvc://workshop/data.csv\", repo=\"https://github.com/...\")` → resolves the repo correctly (the previously broken path)\n- `DVCFileSystem(url=...)` still works unchanged (backward compat), as do positional and `fo=`\n- `repo=Repo(...)` uses the instance directly (`fs._repo is dvc`)\n\n**Test results:** all 164 fs/dependency unit tests pass, 34 API functional tests pass, and the wider sweep (`test_get`, `test_external_repo`, `tests/unit/repo`, `tests/func/api`) passes except for 3 failures that reproduce on the clean tree (1 in `test_show` stage-runner, 2 celery `executor_status`) — all unrelated to this change.","citations":[]}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"SiliconFlow","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ced045f-2deb-4a03-96b6-51f3c49ecc7b","uuid":"65c5fc58-ecd3-4721-b307-caf30cee1faa","timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:26:04.084Z","request_id":"gen-1788492335-UVPWQIuO22ND1dISIuX3"}
